      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: We Are So Sorry for Your Delayed Service! Thank You for Your Patience and Understanding!\n\nDear Valued Customer, We sincerely apologize for the delay in your service and truly appreciate your patience and understanding throughout this challenging time. Our team is working tirelessly to resolve this issue immediately, and we are committed to ensuring your satisfaction with our Positive Culture Initiative. Please rest assured that your feedback is valued, and we will follow up with you shortly to confirm everything is back on track.\n\nThank you for being a wonderful part of Vanguard Legal Solutions!",
